 "final_prompt": "I'm cooking lemon garlic chicken with potatoes tonight and only need to buy what I'm missing. I have salt, olive oil and oregano. Produce a four-line list, one item per line, covering chicken, lemons, garlic and potatoes, and nothing about cooking.\n\n<document>\nWeeknight lemon chicken (serves 4)\n\nIngredients\n4 chicken thighs\n2 lemons\n3 cloves garlic\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 tsp dried oregano\n1 lb baby potatoes\nsalt\n\nSteps\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F.\n2. Toss the potatoes with the olive oil and salt.\n3. Rub the chicken with garlic, oregano and lemon zest.\n4. Roast everything for 35 minutes, squeeze the lemons over the top, and serve.\n</document>",
